        "needs-kyc": "User has not passed KYC and has no trading account yet. The Today card shows “How to start” (step 1 is the one to do) with the rate range and “Verify my account”. No account picker and no rates table.",
        "needs-deposit": "User passed KYC but has not made a first deposit and has no trading account yet. The Today card shows “How to start” (step 1 checked, step 2 is the one to do) with the rate range and “Deposit now”. No account picker and no rates table."
      }
